### List invites for a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Respond to an invite
### This currently returns 501 until authentication is implemented.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/invites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}
